== Effects ==
* Creates a trapdoor leading to the next floor. {{dlc|nr}} Has an estimated 1/12 (8%) chance to create a trapdoor leading to a {{r|Crawl Space}} instead.
** {{Dlc+|r}} Some floor tiles will appear with a special decorative graphic (for example, grass or paper in {{s|Basement}}). Using this item on these tiles will guarantee a {{R|Crawl Space}}. Only one Crawl Space can be made per floor, as all subsequent uses will only spawn trapdoors.
